Working with packages:

 - Search:  apk search/pkg search <query>
 - Install: apk add/pkg add <package>
 - Update:  apk update/pkg update
 - Upgrade: apk upgrade/pkg upgrade

Subscribing to additional repositories:

 - X11:     apk add/pkg add x11-repo

Report issues with termux (the app) at https://termux.dev/issues
And any with apk https://github.com/BOBBUBO/apk-tools/issues

